        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "METHOD",
          "title": "邻深度信息和跨曲线信息，各有失效条件",
          "html": "<p>线性插值只用同井可见 GR 的左右端点，按实际深度插值，段首段尾不外推。岭回归使用训练井 RHOB、NPHI 和 log10 RDEP 预测 GR，目标均值作截距、标准化系数做 L2 惩罚。两法不共享预测结果；λ 仅用验证遮挡点选择。</p><figure style=\"margin:20px 0\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line,#d9dcd1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"900\" height=\"320\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"同区残差揭示总体分数背后的差异\" style=\"display:block;max-width:none;background:#fffefa;font-family:Microsoft YaHei,Segoe UI,sans-serif\"><title>同区残差揭示总体分数背后的差异</title><text x=\"25\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#263a35\">测试遮挡点残差：预测 − 观测 / API（只绘制遮挡点）</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#59675f\">纵向满量程 ±472.9 API；横向按遮挡点深度递增排列</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"860\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#c8cec4\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><line x1=\"35\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"35\" y2=\"133.26542955344274\" stroke=\"#a45d36\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><line x1=\"39\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"39\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#256754\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><line x1=\"45.8\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"45.8\" y2=\"105.3347566706367\" stroke=\"#a45d36\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><line x1=\"49.8\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"49.8\" y2=\"217.8829562680965\" stroke=\"#256754\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><line x1=\"56.6\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"56.6\" y2=\"86.92014609774832\" stroke=\"#a45d36\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><line x1=\"60.6\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"60.6\" y2=\"190.27767779776545\" stroke=\"#256754\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><line x1=\"67.4\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"67.4\" y2=\"81.88628488259093\" stroke=\"#a45d36\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><line x1=\"71.4\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"71.4\" y2=\"176.05278507599556\" stroke=\"#256754\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><line x1=\"78.2\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"78.2\" y2=\"84.89440264721328\" stroke=\"#a45d36\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><line x1=\"82.2\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"82.2\" y2=\"169.8721148692954\" stroke=\"#256754\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><line x1=\"89\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"89\" y2=\"89.11766801807082\" stroke=\"#a45d36\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><line x1=\"93\" y1=\"15